<title>AUSTRALIA: ASX substantial shareholding notices - April 29.</title>
<headline>ASX substantial shareholding notices - April 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>Colonial Limited ceased to be a substantial shareholder in Tourism Asset Holdings Limited on 22/04/1997.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>Axiom Funds Management Corporation ceased to be a substantial shareholder in Ashton Mining Limited on 23/04/1997.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
</text>
